So, I was thinking:

You can name your dog, and you can name your fruit, but why can't you
name your gods?
Now, the idea might be a bit touchy to some, but makeing a custom
Nethack relegon is a very good idea!

The idea is that you could set "OPTIONS=customgods" or something so
that, when making your class, you would be asked what your character's
religion is, such as default (decided by class), Norse, Mesoamerican,
Discworldian, ECT.

Also, you could set "OPTIONS=cha/law/neu god:$name" so that if you
want your own gods you could set them, and "OPTIONS=customreligion:
$name,$abbreviation(such as Nor for Norse)"

I'm not sure if it would break save files, but it would also be cool
if you could have your religion listed in your high score table, for
example: "Edrobot, the Chaotic, Norse, Gomish Wizard" Or,  "Edrobot,
Chaotic Gnomish Wizard, follower of Loki"

Most of this doesn't sound very hard to do, so PLEASE someone make a
patch for this!



